    "## 3. Forward Diffusion\n",
    "We define a noise schedule βₜ and compute:\n",
    "\n",
    "- αₜ = 1 − βₜ\n",
    "- \\bar{α}ₜ = Πₛ≤ₜ αₛ\n",
    "\n",
    "Sampling noisy image:\n",
    "$$x_t = \\sqrt{\\bar{\\alpha}_t} x_0 + \\sqrt{1-\\bar{\\alpha}_t}\\,\\epsilon,\\quad \\epsilon\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,I)$$\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
